        ],
        "id": "wood-frog-freeze-tolerance.asset.how-freezing-works.script.chemistry",
        "text": "At the same time, its liver releases a surge of glucose, while urea adds another layer of protection.",
        "type": "factual"
      },
      {
        "claimIds": [
          "wood-frog-freeze-tolerance.claim.urea-and-glucose",
          "wood-frog-freeze-tolerance.claim.ice-redistribution"
        ],
        "id": "wood-frog-freeze-tolerance.asset.how-freezing-works.script.protection",
        "text": "Together, those defenses limit ice formation and help protect membranes and other cell structures.",
